# (E13) the default browser kept as docs/GUIDE.md section 21 advises: asked once, again when the
# app is active again (UIC_ACTIVE 1).  `system browser` changes the answer of the headless run
# and sends the round trip through the system's settings itself: no `system focus out / in`
theme light
expect text:"Browser: ein anderer, 1 Mal gefragt" exists
expect text:"Aktiv: nein  Schlaf: nein  Ende: 0" exists
# not active: the app gets the keyboard (UIC_ACTIVE 1) and asks again
system browser default
expect text:"Browser: Standard, 2 Mal gefragt" exists
expect text:"Aktiv: ja  Schlaf: nein  Ende: 0" exists
# active: it loses the keyboard and gets it back (UIC_ACTIVE 0, 1), still active afterwards
system browser unknown
expect text:"Browser: unbekannt, 3 Mal gefragt" exists
expect text:"Aktiv: ja  Schlaf: nein  Ende: 0" exists
system browser other
expect text:"Browser: ein anderer, 4 Mal gefragt" exists
# frames alone do not ask again
wait 100
expect text:"Browser: ein anderer, 4 Mal gefragt" exists
# the app loses the keyboard by itself: kept, asked again when it is back
system focus out
expect text:"Aktiv: nein  Schlaf: nein  Ende: 0" exists
expect text:"Browser: ein anderer, 4 Mal gefragt" exists
system focus in
expect text:"Browser: ein anderer, 5 Mal gefragt" exists
expect_nowarn
